[Cheats/Enable Debug Mode Press and hold L2+R1 for Quick Start menu when starting a normal mode game This lets you change the game mode, course, and number of players. Press and hold L2+R2 for Comline This menu doesn't work anymore. Debug Menu when starting a normal mode game.Press and hold R3 while in-game for another debug menu This lets you edit parameters such as the map color.]
